Dear friends,
„My Memory of Us” is finally Steam Deck compatible and with this update, we have introduced some Quality of Life improvements:
- Steam Deck buttons are displayed as prompts, both in-game and in menus;
- the Options menu shows controls mapped over the Steam Deck controller;
- the game supports the Steam Deck 1200x800 resolution;
- you can change the music and SFX volume while playing the game, without having to enter the Options menu;
- minor fixes.

Get the game with 80% off for the whole week!

Follow us on our social media to receive the latest news – we might have some big ones coming…!
